    "All six correlated TCPIP Not locally destined drops occurred inside same-host DR-port VNET_ENCAP_LAYER removal-to-addition intervals.",
    "Each matching inbound flow was created with EncapHeaderAction=Ignore inside that interval, before its corresponding packet drop.",
    "HNS intervals containing drops were approximately 15.316, 17.343 and 32.290 milliseconds. Other observed rebuilds need not drop packets.",
    "Native TimerCallback activity IDs group the operations in the first Windows 2022 and Windows 2025 failure intervals. Activity IDs can be reused, so later operations require ordered pairing.",
    "An adjacent GoalStateDriverCallBack identifies the External overlay network; this is context, not proof that deleting that network is safe."
  ],
